      "full_text": "In addition to his parents he was preceded in death by his sisters, Frances \n  Pritchett and Freida Reed and brothers, James Samuel Greenage and Phillip Howard \n  Greenage (infant). He is survived by his wife of 61 years, Norma Rae Carney \n  Greenage of Dover, DE; sons, Paul W. Greenage and his wife, Helene of Milford, \n  DE, Mark J. Greenage and his wife Dottie of Vero Beach, FL; sisters, Katherine \n  Clark of Oak Orchard, DE, Regina Techkerian and her husband Khaja of Philadelphia, \n  PA, Rachel Lorraine Coker and her husband Charles Edward of Dover, DE and Myrtle \n  Mosley of Columbia, MD; grandson, Michael Greenage and his wife Laura of Roanoke, \n  VA and a host of nieces and nephews.",
